{"title":"도쿄 테디 베어","artist":"Neru","sourceId":"reference:gZY4Esj0uP7vs9JTGDIP","sourceHash":"4f18f6e3939285d617a9f2316d28754a2aa4250372e3af1a6108eeca72da40d8","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":33734863,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.17,"end":6.05,"text":"父さん母さん 今までごめん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.05,"end":10.76,"text":"膝を震わせ 親指しゃぶる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":10.76,"end":15.4,"text":"兄さん姉さん それじゃあまたね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":15.4,"end":19.7,"text":"冴えない靴の 踵潰した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":29.87,"end":34.33,"text":"見え張ったサイズで 型紙を取る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":34.33,"end":38.5,"text":"何だっていいのさ 代わりになれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":38.5,"end":43.17,"text":"愛されたいと 口を零した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":43.17,"end":45.45,"text":"もっと丈夫な ハサミで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":45.45,"end":47.52,"text":"顔を切り取るのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":47.52,"end":51.9,"text":"全智全能の言葉を ほら聞かせてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":51.9,"end":54.55,"text":"脳みそ以外 もういらないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":54.55,"end":56.61,"text":"Why not, I don't know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":56.61,"end":61.27,"text":"近未来創造 明日の傷創 ただ揺らしてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":61.27,"end":66.41,"text":"縫い目の隙間を埋めておくれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":76.21000000000001,"end":81.07,"text":"皆さんさようなら 先生お元気で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":81.07,"end":85.48,"text":"高なった胸に 涎(よだれ)が垂れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":85.48,"end":90.28999999999999,"text":"正直者は何を見る？ 正直者は馬鹿を見る！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":90.28999999999999,"end":94.97,"text":"正直者は何を見る？ 正直者は馬鹿を見る！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":94.97,"end":99.5,"text":"あー、これじゃまだ足りないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":99.5,"end":103.83,"text":"もっと大きな ミシンで 心貫くのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":103.83,"end":108.50999999999999,"text":"全智全能の言葉を ほら聞かせてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":108.50999999999999,"end":111.31,"text":"脳みそ以外 もういらないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":111.31,"end":113.38,"text":"Why not, I don't know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":113.38,"end":118.0,"text":"近未来創造 明日の傷創 ただ揺らしてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":118.0,"end":123.27,"text":"縫い目の隙間を埋めておくれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":132.05,"end":136.95,"text":"もう何も無いよ 何も無いよ 引き剥がされて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":136.95,"end":141.65,"text":"糸屑の 海へと この細胞も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":141.65,"end":146.25,"text":"そうボクいないよ ボクいないよ 投げ捨てられて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":146.25,"end":150.98,"text":"帰る場所すら何処にも 無いんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":150.98,"end":155.63,"text":"存在証明。 あー、shut up ウソだらけの体","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":155.63,"end":160.32,"text":"完成したいよ ズルしたいよ 今、解答を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":160.32,"end":162.53,"text":"変われないの？ 飼われたいの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":162.53,"end":165.28,"text":"何も無い？ こんなのボクじゃない！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":165.28,"end":170.43,"text":"縫い目は解けて引き千切れた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":180.63,"end":185.0,"text":"煮え立ったデイズで 命火を裁つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":185.0,"end":187.97,"text":"誰だっていいのさ 代わりになれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}